<%--
Person_Avatar - a person's face: a profile image or a deterministic initials disc

$name (string)          - the person's name; alt text, initials fallback, colour seed [required]
$attachment_id (nullable) - the person's profile-photo File_Attachment id; the photo is shown
                          instead of the initials disc when set [optional]
$initials (string)      - explicit initials override; derived from $name when absent [optional]
$size ("sm"|"md"|"lg")  - 28 / 36 / 72px disc; default "md" [optional]

Display-only (no JS file). The initials-disc background is a deterministic hue from
the initials, so a person reads with a consistent colour everywhere. Consumed by
Author_Meta_Row and directly wherever a person needs a face (thread participants, the
contact-card modal). Promoted from the per-page Request/Portal_Participant_Avatar.

Usage:
    <Person_Avatar $name="Lisa Brown" $attachment_id=_p.avatar_attachment_id $size="sm" />

A person's face is never an image URL in a payload. The producer ships the profile photo's
attachment id and <Attachment_Thumbnail> renders it - so a re-cropped or newly uploaded photo
replaces itself everywhere it is on screen, with no page reload.
--%>
<Define:Person_Avatar tag="span">
  <% const _size = this.args.size === 'sm' ? 'sm' : (this.args.size === 'lg' ? 'lg' : 'md');
     const _name = str(this.args.name);
     // Explicit initials win; otherwise derive from the first two words of the name.
     let _initials = str(this.args.initials).trim();
     if (!_initials) {
         const _parts = _name.trim().split(' ').filter(Boolean);
         _initials = _parts.slice(0, 2).map((w) => w.charAt(0)).join('');
     }
     _initials = (_initials || '?').toUpperCase();
     // Deterministic background hue from the initials (consistent per person).
     let _hue = 0;
     for (let i = 0; i < _initials.length; i++) { _hue = (_hue + _initials.charCodeAt(i) * 37) % 360; }
     const _bg = 'hsl(' + _hue + ', 45%, 45%)';
     this.$.addClass('Person_Avatar--' + _size); %>
  <% const _px = _size === 'sm' ? 28 : (_size === 'lg' ? 72 : 36); %>
  <% if (this.args.attachment_id) { %>
    <span class="Person_Avatar__disc">
      <Attachment_Thumbnail class="Person_Avatar__photo" $attachment_id=int(this.args.attachment_id) $type="cover" $width=_px $height=_px $alt=_name />
    </span>
  <% } else { %>
    <%-- background-color is inline: a per-person deterministic hue is data, not a token. --%>
    <span class="Person_Avatar__disc Person_Avatar__disc--initials" style="background-color: <%= _bg %>"><%= _initials %></span>
  <% } %>
</Define:Person_Avatar>
